18:- A provider failure skips `afterModelResponse` ([validated by: not called when stream throws](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L252)).
19:- `onError` observes a failure but does not replace the caller's rejection ([validated by: error still propagates after onError hook](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L296)).
20:- An orchestrator with no hooks installed processes a message normally ([validated by: works without any hooks configured](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L382)).
30:- `beforeSession` is inside the `try` block, so a throw there reaches the `catch`/`finally` blocks, firing both `onError` and `afterSession`, where a deployer can assume no tools were run and the turn was aborted before provider interaction ([validated by: runs onError and afterSession when beforeSession throws](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.beforeSession.acceptance.test.ts#L40), [validated by: reports and cleans up when it throws before a turn starts](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L116)).

